# Shared LaTeX build products
**/build/
# Course-local HTML is disposable. GitHub Actions publishes it to Pages.
**/site/
**/*.aux
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.toc
**/*.fdb_latexmk
**/*.fls
**/*.synctex.gz
**/*.synctex(busy)
**/*.pdfsync
**/*.bbl
**/*.blg
**/*.bcf
**/*.run.xml

# Generated PDFs and pagination previews stay local. The repository keeps
# editable sources/snapshots and their authored figure assets instead.
**/main.pdf
**/docs/*.pdf
**/pages/
**/contact-sheets/
